Comment: 0,0:07:19.54,0:07:20.64,Karaoke - 04 dance franz,,0,0,0,karaoke,Hey
Comment: 0,0:07:20.66,0:07:24.01,Karaoke - 04 dance franz,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k24}Ta{\k22}bi {\k25}ni {\k26}tsu{\k31}na{\k19}ga{\k24}re{\k43}-tsu, {\k7}me{\k30}chi {\k21}ni {\k20}ta{\k16}ta{\k18}ka{\k9}re...
Comment: 0,0:07:20.66,0:07:24.01,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Chained to this voyage, beaten along the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.55,0:07:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Row, row!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.30,0:07:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No slacking!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.18,0:07:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll skin you alive!
